note":"Click anything, choose Program, and change a number"}},{"id":"3bfcecd3-a78e-4036-8bc4-aaecdba98779","createdAt":1786969678818,"transform":{"position":[17,0.009564933279655463,64],"rotation":[0,-1.039072259536091,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"browser-kiosk","options":{"centreY":4}},{"id":"8698e3fb-5c9a-4547-85f4-35eaa2c8efd3","createdAt":1786969678819,"transform":{"position":[17,4.0095649332796555,64],"rotation":[0,-1.039072259536091,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"web-browser","url":"http://edusim3dweb.com"},{"id":"fbc9763c-f958-427c-9bdd-56457d2bfafc","createdAt":1786969678820,"transform":{"position":[-16,-7.549516567451064e-15,34],"rotation":[0,0.3805063771123649,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":1,"title":"Fly the balloon","target":"the red hot-air balloon","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"forever","depth":0},{"cat":"motion","text":"move up by 0.4 feet","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 0.1 seconds","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"move up by -0.4 feet","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 0.1 seconds","depth":1}],"tip":"Up is always up, whichever way a thing is pointing — that is the one movement block that ignores facing. Make the two numbers different and the balloon drifts away.","accent":"#f2545b"}},{"id":"00588cae-fad5-489e-b4e1-95e6b09e6d6b","createdAt":1786969678821,"transform":{"position":[16,-7.549516567451064e-15,34],"rotation":[0,-0.3805063771123649,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":2,"title":"Walk the wind-up toy in a square","target":"the blue wind-up toy","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"forever","depth":0},{"cat":"control","text":"repeat 4 times","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"glide 12 feet over 3 seconds","depth":2},{"cat":"motion","text":"rotate 90 degrees","depth":2}],"tip":"360 divided by 4 is 90, which is why it comes back to exactly where it started. Try repeat 3 with rotate 120, or repeat 6 with rotate 60.","accent":"#4fc3d9"}},{"id":"26726fe3-1572-4ba8-85c1-9e2b6a23cf93","createdAt":1786969678823,"transform":{"position":[-34,-0.1312544728409768,54],"rotation":[0,1.039072259536091,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":3,"title":"Grow the toadstool","target":"the red mushroom house","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"forever","depth":0},{"cat":"look","text":"change size by 8 %","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 0.4 seconds","depth":1},{"cat":"look","text":"change size by -8 %","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 0.4 seconds","depth":1}],"tip":"Plus 8 then minus 8 does NOT come back to the same size — each one is a percentage of whatever it is now. Watch it slowly shrink, then work out why.","accent":"#f2a541"}},{"id":"0a50b2f9-58f9-4c82-ba19-3ccd74cd9cfe","createdAt":1786969678824,"transform":{"position":[34,0.054984249849419964,58],"rotation":[0,-1.1309537439791604,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":4,"title":"Make the flower change colour","target":"the pink giant flower","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"forever","depth":0},{"cat":"look","text":"change color to 🟣","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 1 seconds","depth":1},{"cat":"look","text":"change color to 🟡","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 1 seconds","depth":1}],"tip":"Add a third colour and a third wait and you have a traffic light. Take the waits out and see what happens — it is still working, just too fast to see.","accent":"#e86bb5"}},{"id":"ec2b1f0f-a04b-4d8e-992f-2a6dff57eb65","createdAt":1786969678825,"transform":{"position":[22,8.881784197001251e-16,-4],"rotation":[0,-0.27490984148067255,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":5,"title":"Speed up the carousel","target":"the carousel itself","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"forever","depth":0},{"cat":"motion","text":"rotate 0.5 degrees","depth":1}],"tip":"This one is ALREADY running — click the carousel and choose Program to read it. Change 0.5 to 6 and hold on. A negative number turns it the other way.","accent":"#7a6ff0"}},{"id":"a527c2b8-0ee6-4b68-b068-c2ad2f4b26b6","createdAt":1786969678826,"transform":{"position":[0,10.000000000000005,-22],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"light-orb","color":"#f2a541"},{"id":"edde992b-3f55-4e67-9929-5fbb487c16b7","createdAt":1786969678827,"transform":{"position":[-38,7.997448639610681,30],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"light-orb","color":"#e0455f"}]}